On Windows, track proto rebuilds per file instead of running protoc with
--dependency_out=/dev/stdout, which does not exist there and fails the build.

Files changed:
  crates/build/xai-proto-build/src/lib.rs

diff --git a/crates/build/xai-proto-build/src/lib.rs b/crates/build/xai-proto-build/src/lib.rs
